{"title": "Blocked by Bhaalist Mischief (Condition)", "pageid": 40203, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Blocked_by_Bhaalist_Mischief_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Lock Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Blocked by Bhaalist Mischief</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>This door cannot be opened until the Farslayer is defeated. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARCANE_LOCK</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CARCANE_LOCK%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CARCANE_LOCK%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>ARCANE_LOCK</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Arcane_Lock\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Lock_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Lock (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Lock\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Lock_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Lock (Condition)\">Arcane Lock</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Locked through magical means. Can't be opened by lockpicking or the use of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knock\" title=\"Knock\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Knock_Icon.webp/25px-Knock_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Knock_Icon.webp/38px-Knock_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Knock_Icon.webp/50px-Knock_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knock\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Knock_Icon.webp/25px-Knock_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Knock_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knock\" title=\"Knock\">Knock</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Blocked_by_Bhaalist_Mischief\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blocked_by_Bhaalist_Mischief_(Condition)\" title=\"Blocked by Bhaalist Mischief (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blocked by Bhaalist Mischief\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Arcane_Lock_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a cla